 "strings": {
  "Except you're still a good kid at heart!": "",
  "Excuse me.": "",
  "Tea.": "",
  "Here you go.": "",
  "So then...": "",
  "So?": "",
  "What would drag you back to an office\nwhere you're not exactly welcome?": "",
  "What drags you into an office\nwhere you're unwelcome?": "",
  "Hamura is giving me some grief.": "",
  "It's about Captain Hamura.　": "",
  "Is he now?": "",
  "Oh, that?": "",
  "I was under the assumption\nGenda is handling the issue.": "",
  "We asked Genda-san to defend him.": "",
  "Are you helping him\nout with the case now?": "",
  "Are you helping out with that, too?": "",
  "Shintani's got me looking\nfor the Kyorei Clan.": "",
  "The Kyorei Clan has a base\nin Kamurocho, right?": "",
  "Just need to find them,\nso I can ask them a few things.": "",
  "I need to find it so I can ask a few things.": "",
  "Not wise, my boy. You do know\nthey're all up in arms right now.": "",
  "You know they're all\nup in arms right now, right?": "",
  "Sure you want this?": "",
  "You sure that's wise?": "",
  "Don't worry.\nI just want to have a word.": "",
  "I just want to have a word.": "",
  "Does the name the Kajihira Group\nmean anything to you?": "",
  "Heard of a construction company\ncalled the Kajihira Group?": "",
  "No. Can't say that it does.": "",
  "No, not really.": "",
  "They're a Kansai outfit.": "",
  "They're big in Kansai.": "",
  "It's... They've got a front in the city.\nThe KJ Art office down on Senryo Avenue. ": "",
  "Anyway, they've got an office\ncalled KJ Art on Senryo Avenue.": "",
  "Be careful, though. There's Kyorei crawling on every floor.\nThese are Tojo Clan streets, but that's their turf now.": "",
  "That whole building is theirs.\nAnd that's where you'll find the Kyorei Clan.": "",
  "Senryo Avenue. KJ Art, eh.": "",
  "Senryo Avenue, KJ Art, right?": "",
  "I'll check it out.": "",
  "I know you're busy...": "",
  "Sounds like you're a busy guy.": "",
  "Although, you think I could visit your office\nsome day soon? Keep it on the downlow?": "",
  "You know, I'd like to visit your office\nsometime. Our secret, of course.": "",
  "Yeah, of course.": "",
  "Hey, you!": "",
  "Hey, asshole!": "",
  "I know you, boy!?": "",
  "Look who it is!": "",
  "Murase?": "",
  "What a coincidence.": "",
  "What a coincidence!": "",
  "Clear your schedule,\n'cause I'm gonna take my time with you.": "",
  "I'm gonna take my sweet time with you...": "",
  "Boys!": "",
  "Get this fucker back to the office!": "",
  "I really don't have time for this.": "",
  "Crap, this wasn't on the agenda...": "",
  "Yo, Tak!": "",
  "Tak!": "",
  "Kaito-san!": "",
  "Kaito-san!?": "",
  "Stay the fuck outta this!": "",
  "Where are you...!?": "",
  "Wait, what?": "",
  "C'mon!": "",
  "Let's do this!": "",
  "That was pretty sweet, man.": "",
  "That was pretty badass, man!": "",
  "Hey, you want to try helping out?": "",
  "You want in, Tak!?": "",
  "Sure thing.": "",
  "Sure do.": "",
  "My turn!": "",
  "You two...": "",
  "You two fuckers are going down now!": "",
  "You're both gonna fuckin' die!": "",
  "This video shows everything\nyou need to see.": "",
  "This camera captured everything of note.": "",
  "My client, Hamura-san, drunkenly attacked\nthis passerby on the night of the murder.": "",
  "This is the defendant drunkenly attacking\na passerby on the night of the murder.": "",
  "Then, after the altercation, that same passerby\nwatched Hamura-san walk into Sauna Goten.": "",
  "After the altercation, the passerby witnessed\nthe defendant entering the sauna.": "",
  "Nobody came out of the building after that\nuntil the trains started in the morning.": "",
  "No one left the sauna\nafter this until the first train.": "",
  "Meaning the defendant was accounted\nfor during the hours in question.": "",
  "In other words, the defendant\nwas in there until morning.": "",
  "The defense asserts that this video\nestablishes a clear alibi...\n ": "",
  "This establishes a clear alibi\nfor the defendant's whereabouts...": "",
  "...which can only be seen\nas proof of Hamura-san's innocence. ": "",
  "...And his innocence.": "",
  "To that end,\nI have a question for the prosecution.": "",
  "On that note, a query for the prosecution.": "",
  "Did you have any prior knowledge\nof this video before the trial began?": "",
  "Were you unaware of this footage\nbefore proceeding to trial?": "",
  "I assure you that we reviewed all the relevant footage from\nthe sauna. And yet the defendant was nowhere to be found, council.": "",
  "The police looked into footage from around\nthe sauna, but never picked up the defendant.　": "",
  "At least so I was told.": "",
  "That's what I was given.": "",
  "Meaning, you never actually went to examine the site\npersonally then. Would you say that's correct?": "",
  "So the prosecution never\ninspected the sauna personally?": "",
  "Yes.\nMy associates took care of that.": "",
  "Correct. I never inspected it.": "",
  "Nonetheless, the defense's video is far too blurry\nto clearly identify either participant.": "",
  "Regardless, the defense's footage\nis far too blurry to be definitive.": "",
  "There's no way to tell whether the man in the footage\nwas the defendant or just a random pedestrian.": "",
  "I cannot agree with their assertion\nthat the defendant is clearly visible.": "",
  "Thank you very much.": "",
  "Very well.": "",
  "In that case, the defense would\nlike to call a witness to the stand.": "",
  "In that case,\nthe defense would like to call a witness.": "",
  "Seiya-san. Do you claim you're\nthe person in this video?": "",
  "This is the man who was assaulted in the footage.": "",
  "That someone assaulted you\nthat night. Is that accurate?": "",
  "That was you in the footage, yes?\nCan you attest to that?": "",
  "It is.": "",
  "Now tell us.\nThis person who assaulted you...": "",
  "And the person who assaulted you...": "",
  "Are they here in the courtroom?": "",
  "...Is here in this courtroom, yes?": "",
  "Hm?": "",
  "Witness. Is there a problem?": "",
  "Witness? Everything okay?": "",
  "I, um...": "",
  "I must have been mistaken.": "",
  "I... was mistaken.": "",
  "I am the one getting\nhit in the video.": "",
  "That's definitely me getting punched...": "",
  "But as to who the\nother guy was...": "",
  "But as for who did it...": "",
  "I can't say.": "",
  "...I couldn't say.": "",
  "Excuse me, Your Honor.\nA recess, if you don't mind.": "",
  "Your Honor, my apologies.\nI'd like to request a recess.": "",
  "The night Kume got murdered...": "",
  "At the time of Kume's murder...": "",
  "Hamura was holed up\nin Sauna Goten 'til morning.": "",
  "...Hamura was at Sauna Goten\nuntil morning.": "",
  "The footage from the security camera,\nHamura's alibi, Seiya's testimony; it all lined up.": "",
  "The security camera footage and Hamura's own\ntestimony lined up perfectly with what Seiya said.": "",
  "With a story that airtight,\nthere's no chance he could've killed Kume.": "",
  "With an airtight alibi, there was no way\nHamura could have killed Kume.": "",
  "We find... the defendant,\nKyohei Hamura...": "",
  "We hereby find the defendant,\nKyohei Hamura...": "",
  "...Innocent.": "",
  "I will now clarify the reasoning behind\nthis decision. Defendant, please be seated.": "",
  "Let's proceed to the court's rationale.\nThe defendant may be seated.": "",
  "The judge was right.": "",
  "It was the truth.": "",
  "Hamura definitely didn't kill Kume.": "",
  "Hamura definitely wasn't\nthe one who killed Kume.": "",
  "But he had to have been involved.": "",
  "But... he had to have been an accomplice.": "",
  "Meanwhile, the real killer is still\nout there, hiding in the shadows of Kamurocho.": "",
  "The true culprit vanished into the darkness,\nso I started calling him... the Mole.": "",
  "Murdering yakuza. Gouging their eyes out.\nRetreating into his den.": "",
  "A blind creature using its claws to gouge\nits victim's eyes, only to burrow again.": "",
  "So, I've given him a name.": "",
  "And...": "",
  "The Mole.": "",
  "Somewhere under Kamurocho,\nhe's still out there.": "",
  "A lawyer's job is done once he\nproves the defendant innocent.": "",
  "For a lawyer, the job ends when he's\nproven his client innocent of all crimes.": "",
  "But me? I'm not a lawyer.\nNot anymore.": "",
  "That said...\nI'm not a lawyer anymore.": "",
  "Meaning my search for the truth\nonly ends when I say it does.": "",
  "It's totally up to me if I decide to pursue\nthis case and bring the truth to light.": "",
  "My office might be small, but that doesn't\nmean I don't have a reputation to uphold.": "",
  "In a city this small, in a tiny office like mine...\nI have to work for my reputation.": "",
  "Basically...": "",
  "I'll do whatever it takes to\nbring Hamura and the Mole down.": "",
  "Hamura and the Mole\naren't going to get the best of me.": "",
  "Yagami-san.\nNice seeing you.": "",
  "Yagami-san... right?": "",
  "Gorgeous day.": "",
  "You're doing well, huh?": "",
  "How's the detective business\nbeen treating you lately?": "",
  "How's the Kamurocho detective thing going?": "",
  "Yeah, I knew you'd show up here, Hattori.": "",
  "I knew you'd be watching this.": "",
  "Listen. I'm not in the mood\nfor your shit today.": "",
  "But I've got nothing to say to you.": "",
  "Ah, but it's my journalistic duty\nto hear what you have to say.": "",
  "I'm just a journalist hoping you\nmight have a comment for me.": "",
  "It's not personal,\njust trying to do my job, okay?": "",
  "It's not like I have a grudge\nagainst you personally.": "",
  "Well I've already seen what your\nso-called \"job\" produces.": "",
  "\"The Fraud Who Let a Murderer Run Free\"": "",
  "\"Fraudulent lawyer lets a murderer walk.\nHelpless girl suffers the consequences.\"": "",
  "Your articles don't change no matter\nhow I answer your questions.": "",
  "You and I both know.": "",
  "Don't you forget...": "",
  "You're the only reason the girl died. You just had\nto go and set that killer free, didn't you?": "",
  "The family of that girl murdered\nby the killer you set loose...": "",
  "And the good people who\nraised her still suffer for it.": "",
  "They're still suffering to this day.": "",
  "You can't be coming back now. What would her\npoor family have to say to that? Huh, Yagami-san?": "",
  "Don't tell me you're staging a\ncomeback despite that, Yagami-san.": "",
  "No need to worry about that.": "",
  "Nobody said anything of the sort.": "",
  "If you say so.": "",
  "Is that so?": "",
  "See you around then.": "",
  "Have it your way.": "",
  "Stop right there!": "",
  "Hey, What's up?": "",
  "Hello?": "",
  "What— Get back here!": "",
  "Hey, wait!": "",
  "Hold it! Stooop!": "",
  "Don't you run!": "",
  "Wait, wrong guy!": "",
  "Wait, me? <font_kind=yakuza_italic>Me</font_kind>?": "",
  "Okay, let's go.": "",
  "You asked for it!": "",
  "You're not...\ngetting any thanks for that.": "",
  "Hope you're not...\nexpecting thanks...": "",
  "Here. You earned this back.": "",
  "Here! You've earned it.": "",
  "I <font_kind=yakuza_italic>own</font_kind> it!": "",
  "Look, it wasn't a perfect plan,\nbut it worked out in the end, didn't it?": "",
  "This wasn't really the plan,\nbut you ended up helping me out.": "",
  "So thanks!": "",
  "Thank you!": "",
  "Is that what you call that?": "",
  "What plan, exactly?": "",
  "And I don't want your thanks, asshole.": "",
  "And don't give me that \"thank you\" crap!": "",
  "Heh... Okay, see ya.": "",
  "See ya around.": "",
  "And that's the Kamurocho burglary ring...\nNo wonder the cops can't catch 'em.": "",
  "Was he in that Kamurocho burglary ring?": "",
  "Stand still and fight me like a man!": "",
  "Stand still and get wrecked!": "",
  "Come in.": "",
  "It's open.": "",
  "Hamura...": "",
  "Pretty expensive tastes.\nSorta outta your price range, huh?": "",
  "For a broke guy,\nyou sure pick some classy spots.": "",
  "Why are you even here?": "",
  "Why are you here?": "",
  "What's going on?": "",
  "Maybe I should be asking\nyou the same question, yeah?": "",
  "The question is, why are <font_kind=yakuza_italic>you</font_kind> here? Huh?": "",
  "Not that I need to.": "",
  "Doesn't matter.": "",
  "Why are you still looking\ninto the Kyorei murders, Tak?": "",
  "You been sniffing around the Kyorei murders?": "",
  "Keep your eyes to yourself unless\nyou wanna lose 'em. Are we clear?": "",
  "This doesn't concern you anymore.\nWhat's your problem?": "",
  "You don't get to decide what I do.": ""
 },
